{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "‘I just need a quick look at settlement amounts.’"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After granting such a request, we also need to manage when access ends, avoiding exceptions that remain after the task is over."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Part 13 requested settlement-table access. Here I checked screens and query results after its approved period ended. Managing approved exceptions together was particularly convenient."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A Settlement Table Opened for One Hour"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Developer normally could query orders but not settlement_details. A separate request sought access for reconciling order 4002’s settlement."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Alongside table and reason, the request specified a start and duration: one hour from 17:00 on November 8, 2026."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/temporary-policy-exceptions/01.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 1. Settlement access request retains start time, one-hour duration, and business reason.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 1. Settlement access request retains start time, one-hour duration, and business reason."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Instead of relying on administrators to remember cleanup, the request defined it up front. Recording task and duration together makes access easier to manage."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Expired Exceptions Are Clearly Marked"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Databases → Policies → Policy Exception listed both the settlement approval and the phone-unmasking exception."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The settlement exception ended at 18:00 and was Expired; the phone exception with time remaining was Active. I did not manually revoke the settlement exception or edit the policy during this check."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/temporary-policy-exceptions/02.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 2. Settlement exception Expired; phone exception still Active.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 2. Settlement exception Expired; phone exception still Active."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "One screen showed who had exceptions for which data, when they ended, and which request authorized them. That should reduce searching through individual approval messages as requests grow."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Web Editor Blocks Settlement Queries"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The developer queried order 4002’s settlement in the web SQL editor. It returned no data, instead reporting no permission for settlement_details."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/temporary-policy-exceptions/03.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 3. After expiration, web-editor settlement access is denied.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 3. After expiration, web-editor settlement access is denied."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Data available during approval was restricted again. Administrators could manage a timed exception without disabling and restoring the shared table policy."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Checking After Reconnecting DBeaver"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I ran the same SQL through QueryPie in DBeaver. A connection opened before expiration could still read settlements, but disconnecting and reconnecting caused the query to be denied for missing table privileges."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/temporary-policy-exceptions/04.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 4. DBeaver settlement queries are blocked after reconnecting.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 4. DBeaver settlement queries are blocked after reconnecting."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "On the same connection, normal order queries still returned order 4002’s status and amount."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/temporary-policy-exceptions/05.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 5. Originally permitted order queries remain available in DBeaver.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 5. Originally permitted order queries remain available in DBeaver."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Temporary settlement access and everyday order queries were managed separately. Sensitive-data exceptions could be controlled while normal work continued."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Reviewing Query Attempts in Audit Logs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Query Audit recorded the recent SQL with the developer, Orders Control Lab, time, Failure, and Prevented."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/temporary-policy-exceptions/06.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 6. User and failed outcome for the DBeaver settlement query.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 6. User and failed outcome for the DBeaver settlement query."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Details included SQL and the no-permission reason. Policy Exception explains the approved window; Query Audit explains actual execution. Together, they support a concrete answer to user questions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/temporary-policy-exceptions/07.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 7. Settlement SQL and table-access denial reason recorded together.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 7. Settlement SQL and table-access denial reason recorded together."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Management Continues After an Exception Is Granted"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Policy Exception lets operators keep track of temporary grants. User, scope, start, end, and status appear together, making active exceptions easy to identify."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "It helps approve necessary access without indefinitely accumulating exceptions. Reasons, duration, and query evidence can be reviewed in sequence to explain privilege management."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This lab used fictional orders with QueryPie Community 11.6.7, MySQL 8.0.42, and DBeaver 26.2.4."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
